+- [ ] 5 binary md5 不变 (install-only ship): weasel.dll `231fd0cfed97fbe6e40c1498cb10a1f1` + weaselx64.dll `ea4dece5b4c76a01704204472c2aa5f4` + WeaselServer.exe `0424eb54380d5cc0ea5b1ca583bf008b` + WeaselDeployer.exe `f8d635342128364056ca748116dceecd` + WeaselSetup.exe `bb4440d6c38a885ee33213d393bf1ab7`
+- [ ] 真机 sandbox-verify `_check_install_v2.ps1` + `System32` weasel*.dll + weasel*.ime 全部 0 命中
+- [ ] 切输入法 explorer / 宿主不再关闭
+
+**Affected files / 提交**:
+
